      "height": 96,
      "strokeColor": "#0f172a",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "text": "Phase 2 — Lab execution (Terminal B) — scenario-specific\n1. Learner → Victim: ./run-ci.sh (act runs ci.yml, else npm start)\n2. Victim → MalPkg: Workflow uses example/actions/checkout@v3 (force-pushed)\n3. MalPkg → MalPkg: Action entrypoint reads GITHUB_TOKEN + env secrets\n4. MalPkg → Mock: POST http://127.0.0.1:3025/collect - CI secrets exfiltrated",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Phase 2 — Lab execution (Terminal B) — scenario-specific\n1. Learner → Victim: ./run-ci.sh (act runs ci.yml, else npm start)\n2. Victim → MalPkg: Workflow uses example/actions/checkout@v3 (force-pushed)\n3. MalPkg → MalPkg: Action entrypoint reads GITHUB_TOKEN + env secrets\n4. MalPkg → Mock: POST http://127.0.0.1:3025/collect - CI secrets exfiltrated",
